   <p><date when="1861-02-12">12</date> 
<lb/>The <persName ref="cwgk:N00000258">Governor</persName> commissioned the following persons in the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000303">Ky State Guard</orgName>. duly elected.</p>
<p><table rend="rules">
<row>
	<cell><persName ref="cwgk:N00021442">A. Madisen</persName></cell>
	<cell>Captain</cell>
	<cell>Home Guards <placeName ref="cwgk:P00000936">Covington</placeName></cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><persName ref="cwgk:N00021355">S. V. Reed</persName></cell>
	<cell>1<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">st</hi></hi> Lieut</cell>
	<cell>" " </cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><persName ref="cwgk:N00021358">W. T. Estep</persName></cell>
	<cell>2<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">nd</hi></hi> " </cell>
	<cell>" " </cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><persName ref="cwgk:N00021361">W. B. Phelps</persName></cell>
	<cell>3<hi rend="sup">d</hi> " </cell>
	<cell>" " </cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><persName ref="cwgk:N00021441">P. H. O Conner</persName></cell>
	<cell>2<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">d</hi></hi> "</cell>
	<cell><placeName ref="cwgk:P00003363">Jackson</placeName> "</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><persName ref="cwgk:N00021435">Jo<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">s</hi></hi> C Mitchell</persName></cell>
	<cell>1<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">st</hi></hi> "</cell>
	<cell>Uniontown Rifle Company</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><persName ref="cwgk:N00021433">Hugh Henry</persName></cell>
	<cell>3<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">d</hi></hi> " </cell>
	<cell><placeName ref="cwgk:P00021443">Flat Rock</placeName> Greys</cell>
</row>
</table></p>
<p>He respited for twelve months a judgment of the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00003470">Frankfort Police Court</orgName> of $10. against <persName ref="cwgk:N00021439">Josh. Vinegar</persName> for a. misdemeanor.</p>
